# Ordo runtime data. Never versioned: it holds real project paths, briefs and
# reports produced by executor sessions. Lives in ORDO_HOME, which defaults to
# ~/.claude/ordo and is outside this repository, unless someone runs a campaign
# on this very repo with the recommended ORDO_HOME=$PWD/.ordo.
/.ordo/
state.json
state.json.lock
/briefs/
/reports/
/journal/
/archives/
/capteurs/
/runs/
*.bak
